Full suite ran once: **559 passed**, no skips/failures, 28 warnings. [Test log](/tmp/exp04_r3afix_full_suite.log)

Compilation and `git diff --check` passed. Exp_03’s pinned files, history, closure and digest remain unchanged. Required trailers are present; no checkpoint/worklog files committed; no push.

Spec clarifications:

- Isolation makes the missing-module reproduction fail before importing a foreign file. Separate tests verify foreign-file diagnostics.
- Bounded evaluations count as smokes for the dirty-tree gate.
- Evaluation has no training-inventory call; training provenance uses bindings. The training launcher now passes the explicit `ckpt/yaw_aug/` cache path.
